puzzle game that you will not be disappointed<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/550310/extras/b5c000c8490b6dc8bbe1f14be2945e3d.avif?t=1586603506\" width=614 height=148 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > About</h2>This game was developed by only one person. Despite of limited human resources, I always try to give you the best experience while gaming.<br><br>With spending a lot of effort on graphics and ingenuity in leading the storyboard, I believe that when you’re gaming you will feel like more than watching a movie. The game have the knots of the past of characters which towards the end of the game everything will gradually clear.",
